    {
      "id": "e05c3ada6f72-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "Simplify (5z - 12y) 2 + (12z + 5y) 2 - 144z 2",
      "questionHtml": "Simplify (5z - 12y)<sup>2&nbsp;</sup>+ (12z + 5y)<sup>2&nbsp;</sup>- 144z<sup>2</sup>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "25z 2 + 169y 2",
          "html": "25z<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2&nbsp;</span>+ 169y<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "23z 2 + 177y 2",
          "html": "23z<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2&nbsp;</span>+ 177y<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "23z 2 + 174y 2",
          "html": "<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">23z</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">+ 174y</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "30z 2 + 170y 2",
          "html": "<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">30z</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">+ 170y</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/shortcut-trick-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /> <u style=\"font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; display: inline !important;\">Shortcut Trick</u></span>\n<p>Use the direct algebraic identity: (ax − by)<sup>2</sup> + (bx + ay)<sup>2</sup> = (a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>)(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>)</p>\n<p>Here, a = 5, b = 12, x = z, and y = y.</p>\n<p>⇒ (5z − 12y)<sup>2</sup> + (12z + 5y)<sup>2</sup> = (5<sup>2</sup> + 12<sup>2</sup>)(z<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>)</p>\n<p>⇒ (25 + 144)(z<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>) = 169z<sup>2</sup> + 169y<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p>Now, simply subtract 144z<sup>2</sup>: 169z<sup>2</sup> + 169y<sup>2</sup> − 144z<sup>2</sup> = 25z<sup>2</sup> + 169y<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p><strong>∴ The correct answer is 25z<sup>2</sup> + 169y<sup>2</sup>.</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/alternate-methord-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Alternate Method</u></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n<p>(5z − 12y)<sup>2</sup> + (12z + 5y)<sup>2</sup> − 144z<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Formula Used:</strong></p>\n<p>(a − b)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2</sup> − 2ab + b<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p>(a + b)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2</sup> + 2ab + b<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Calculations:</strong></p>\n<p>⇒ (5z − 12y)<sup>2</sup> = (5z)<sup>2</sup> − 2 × 5z × 12y + (12y)<sup>2</sup> = 25z<sup>2</sup> − 120yz + 144y<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p>⇒ (12z + 5y)<sup>2</sup> = (12z)<sup>2</sup> + 2 × 12z × 5y + (5y)<sup>2</sup> = 144z<sup>2</sup> + 120yz + 25y<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p>Adding both squared expressions together:</p>\n<p>⇒ (25z<sup>2</sup> − 120yz + 144y<sup>2</sup>) + (144z<sup>2</sup> + 120yz + 25y<sup>2</sup>)</p>\n<p>⇒ 25z<sup>2</sup> + 144z<sup>2</sup> + 144y<sup>2</sup> + 25y<sup>2</sup> − 120yz + 120yz</p>\n<p>⇒ 169z<sup>2</sup> + 169y<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p>Now, substitute this result back into the complete original expression by subtracting 144z<sup>2</sup>:</p>\n<p>⇒ 169z<sup>2</sup> + 169y<sup>2</sup> − 144z<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p>⇒ 25z<sup>2</sup> + 169y<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p><strong>∴ The correct answer is 25z<sup>2</sup> + 169y<sup>2</sup>.</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Additional Information</u></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0 2px 0;font-weight:700;color:#222222;\">Sum and Difference of Squares</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#444444;\">(a + b)<sup>2</sup> + (a − b)<sup>2</sup> = 2(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>). This is useful for quickly simplifying expressions with identical terms.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0 2px 0;font-weight:700;color:#222222;\">Brahmagupta-Fibonacci Identity</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#444444;\">(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>)(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>) = (ax − by)<sup>2</sup> + (bx + ay)<sup>2</sup>. This identity shows that the product of two sums of two squares is itself a sum of two squares.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0 2px 0;font-weight:700;color:#222222;\">Difference of Squares</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#444444;\">a<sup>2</sup> − b<sup>2</sup> = (a + b)(a − b). This is extensively used in algebraic factorisation and rapid calculation.</p></p>",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/shortcut-trick-image.png",
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/alternate-methord-image.png",
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "e05c3ada6f72-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "The value of \\(\\dfrac{{{{5.49}^2} - {{3.51}^2}}}{{5.49 - 3.51}}\\)",
      "questionHtml": "The value of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{{{{5.49}^2} - {{3.51}^2}}}{{5.49 - 3.51}}\\)</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "9",
          "html": "9"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "18.3426",
          "html": "18.3426"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "9.2342",
          "html": "9.2342"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "1844",
          "html": "1844"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{{{{5.49}^2} - {{3.51}^2}}}{{5.49 - 3.51}}\\)</span><span style=\"\">=<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{(5.49 - 3.51)(5.49 + 3.51)}{(5.49 - 3.51)}\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">= 5.49 + 3.51 = 9</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "e05c3ada6f72-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "What is the value of \\(\\frac{1.001 \\times 1.001 \\times 1.001+0.999 \\times 0.999 \\times 0.999}{1.001 \\times 1.001-1.001 \\times 0.999+0.999 \\times 0.999} ?\\)",
      "questionHtml": "<p>What is the value of</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1.001 \\times 1.001 \\times 1.001+0.999 \\times 0.999 \\times 0.999}{1.001 \\times 1.001-1.001 \\times 0.999+0.999 \\times 0.999} ?\\)</span></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "2",
          "html": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "3",
          "html": "3"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "4",
          "html": "4"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<span style='display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;'><img height='26px' src='//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/shortcut-trick-image.png' width='26px' /> <u style='font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; display: inline !important;'>Shortcut Trick</u></span>\n<p>Identify the expression as the <strong>algebraic identity</strong> (a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup>) ÷ (a<sup>2</sup> − ab + b<sup>2</sup>).</p>\n<p>The simplified form of this <strong>identity</strong> is always equal to (a + b).</p>\n<p>Here, let a = 1.001 and b = 0.999.</p>\n<p>Required <strong>Value</strong> = 1.001 + 0.999 = 2.000.</p>\n<p><strong>∴ The correct answer is 2.</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style='display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;'><img height='26px' src='//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/alternate-methord-image.png' width='26px' /><strong><span style='vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;'><u>Alternate Method</u></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n<p>a = 1.001</p>\n<p>b = 0.999</p>\n<p><strong>Formula Used:</strong></p>\n<p>The <strong>sum of cubes</strong> identity is given by: a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> = (a + b)(a<sup>2</sup> − ab + b<sup>2</sup>)</p>\n<p><strong>Calculations:</strong></p>\n<p>⇒ Expression = (1.001 × 1.001 × 1.001 + 0.999 × 0.999 × 0.999) ÷ (1.001 × 1.001 − 1.001 × 0.999 + 0.999 × 0.999)</p>\n<p>⇒ Expression = (1.001<sup>3</sup> + 0.999<sup>3</sup>) ÷ (1.001<sup>2</sup> − 1.001 × 0.999 + 0.999<sup>2</sup>)</p>\n<p>⇒ Expression = [(1.001 + 0.999) × (1.001<sup>2</sup> − 1.001 × 0.999 + 0.999<sup>2</sup>)] ÷ (1.001<sup>2</sup> − 1.001 × 0.999 + 0.999<sup>2</sup>)</p>\n<p>⇒ Expression = 1.001 + 0.999</p>\n<p>⇒ Expression = 2.000</p>\n<p><strong>∴ The correct answer is 2.</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style='display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;'><img height='26px' src='//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png' width='26px' /><strong><span style='vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;'><u>Additional Information</u></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style='margin:8px 0 2px 0;font-weight:700;color:#222222;'>Difference of Cubes Identity</p>\n<p style='margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#444444;'>The formula for the difference of two cubes is a<sup>3</sup> − b<sup>3</sup> = (a − b)(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>).</p>\n<p style='margin:8px 0 2px 0;font-weight:700;color:#222222;'>Difference of Squares</p>\n<p style='margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#444444;'>The identity for the difference of two squares is a<sup>2</sup> − b<sup>2</sup> = (a − b)(a + b).</p>\n<p style='margin:8px 0 2px 0;font-weight:700;color:#222222;'>Square of a Binomial</p>\n<p style='margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#444444;'>The expanded form of (a + b)<sup>2</sup> is a<sup>2</sup> + 2ab + b<sup>2</sup> and for (a − b)<sup>2</sup> is a<sup>2</sup> − 2ab + b<sup>2</sup>.</p>",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/shortcut-trick-image.png",
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/alternate-methord-image.png",
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
