      "id": "e05c3ada6f72-q8",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "If 3&radic;5 + \\(\\sqrt{125}\\) = 17.88, then what will be the value of \\(\\sqrt{80}\\) + 6&radic;5 ?",
      "questionHtml": "If 3&radic;5 +&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt{125}\\)</span> = 17.88, then what will be the value of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt{80}\\)</span> + 6&radic;5 ?&nbsp;",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "13.41",
          "html": "13.41"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "20.46",
          "html": "20.46"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "21.66",
          "html": "21.66"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "22.35",
          "html": "22.35"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">3&radic;5 +&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(√{125}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= 17.88</span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">Calculation:</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">3&radic;5 +&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(√{125}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= 17.88</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 3&radic;5 + 5&radic;5 = 17.88</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 8&radic;5 = 17.88</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Now solving the given value</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;&radic;80 + 6&radic;5 =&nbsp;&radic;(16&nbsp;&times; 5) + 6&radic;5</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 4&radic;5 + 6&radic;5 = 10&radic;5</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">So basically, we need to find out the value of 10&radic;5.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Since 10&radic;5 can be written as below;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 10&radic;5 = 8&radic;5&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;<strong><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{10√ 5}{{8√5}}\\)</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 10&radic;5 =&nbsp;(17.88&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{10√ 5}{{8√5}}\\)</span>)&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; (∵ 8&radic;5 = 17.88)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 10&radic;5 = (17.88&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{5}{{4}}\\)</span>)&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 10&radic;5 = 22.35</span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">&there4; The required value is 22.35.</span></strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
