    {
      "id": "e05c3ada6f72-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "if \\(a + \\frac{1}{a} = 7\\sqrt3 \\) , then what is the value of \\(a^6 + a^{-6}\\) ?",
      "questionHtml": "if <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(a + \\frac{1}{a} = 7\\sqrt3 \\)</span>, then what is the value of <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(a^6 + a^{-6}\\)</span>?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "3048190",
          "html": "3048190"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "3048542",
          "html": "3048542"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "3048132",
          "html": "3048132"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "3048625",
          "html": "3048625"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(a + \\frac{1}{a} = 7\\sqrt3 \\)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Square both sides:</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span class=\"math-tex\">\\( \\Rightarrow (a + \\frac{1}{a})^2 = (7\\sqrt{3})^2 \\)</span> <span class=\"math-tex\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); \">\\( \\Rightarrow a^2 + \\frac{1}{a^2} = 145 \\)</span><img src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAPABAP///wAAACH5BAEKAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" style=\" width: 102.995px; height: 22.9948px;\" /><span style=\"background-image: url(\"https://lms.testbook.com/ng1/admin/vendor/ckeditor/plugins/widget/images/handle.png\"); background-position: initial; background-color: rgba(220, 220, 220, 0.5); transition-duration: 0.2s; transition-delay: 0s; left: 0px; top: -15px;\"><img draggable=\"true\" height=\"15\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAPABAP///wAAACH5BAEKAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" title=\"Click and drag to move\" width=\"15\" /></span></p>\n\n<div>\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Square both sides again:</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span class=\"math-tex\">\\( \\Rightarrow (a^2 + \\frac{1}{a^2})^2 = 145^2 \\)</span>  <span class=\"math-tex\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); \">\\( \\Rightarrow a^4 + \\frac{1}{a^4} = 21023 \\)</span><img src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAPABAP///wAAACH5BAEKAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" style=\" width: 116.997px; height: 22.9948px;\" /><span style=\"background-image: url(\"https://lms.testbook.com/ng1/admin/vendor/ckeditor/plugins/widget/images/handle.png\"); background-position: initial; background-color: rgba(220, 220, 220, 0.5); transition-duration: 0.2s; transition-delay: 0s; left: 0px; top: -15px;\"><img draggable=\"true\" height=\"15\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAPABAP///wAAACH5BAEKAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" title=\"Click and drag to move\" width=\"15\" /></span></p>\n\n<div>\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Using the formula for <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(a^6 + \\frac{1}{a^6}\\)</span> :</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span class=\"math-tex\">\\( \\Rightarrow a^6 + \\frac{1}{a^6} = (a^2 + \\frac{1}{a^2})^3 - 3(a^2 + \\frac{1}{a^2}) \\)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span class=\"math-tex\">\\( \\Rightarrow a^6 + \\frac{1}{a^6} = 145^3 - 3 \\times 145 \\)</span> = 3048190</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
